  "description": "A simply supported symmetric cross-ply laminate under uniform compression tests composite bending stiffness, prestress and the first six buckling roots against the finite-plate Navier solution.",
  "geometry": "Plate 0.6 m by 0.4 m, thickness 2 mm; CQUAD4 meshes from 4x4 to 64x64.",
  "material": "[0/90/90/0], four 0.5 mm plies. E1 = 135 GPa, E2 = 10 GPa, G12 = G13 = G23 = 5 GPa, nu12 = 0.3.",
  "boundary_conditions": "All four edges uz=0; bending rotations free. ux=0 at x=0; origin uy=0; drilling rotation constrained.",
